  "title": "Easy Spaghetti Pie",
  "description": "This spaghetti pie recipe features layers of cheesy baked pasta, hearty meat sauce, and melted mozzarella for a comforting family-pleasing dinner.",
  "authors": [
    "Jennifer"
  ],
