  "ingredients": [
    "butter for greasing",
    "1 (6 ounce) package spaghetti",
    "0.33333331346512 cup grated Parmesan cheese",
    "2 eggs, beaten",
    "2 tablespoons butter",
    "1 pound lean ground beef",
    "0.5 cup chopped onion",
    "0.25 cup chopped green bell pepper",
    "1 clove garlic, minced",
    "1 (14.5 ounce) can diced tomatoes",
    "1 (6 ounce) can tomato paste",
    "1 teaspoon white sugar",
    "1 teaspoon dried oregano",
    "1 cup cottage cheese",
    "0.5 cup shredded mozzarella cheese"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease a 10-inch pie plate with 1 tablespoon butter.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/hB9njDm2uJDSvOPN7WCM9v1lUZg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/11837-spaghetti-pie-ii-VAT-step-01-daf03a0804054503af09568f16bf46fd.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11837/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring a large pot of lightly salted water to a boil. Cook spaghetti in boiling water, stirring occasionally, until tender yet firm to the bite, about 12 minutes. Drain spaghetti through a colander and return to the pot.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/hYhJ64l2JZQbdsOWXg714u6Graw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/11837-spaghetti-pie-ii-VAT-step-02-0221acf1f1f5468ea67f5277dc63f627.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11837/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir Parmesan cheese, beaten eggs, and 2 tablespoons butter into hot spaghetti until well combined. Press mixture evenly on the bottom and up the sides of prepared pie plate to form a sturdy crust.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/0bj0erR9Ig6qpmGQVkt3zIj9jVw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/11837-spaghetti-pie-ii-VAT-step-03-05e39f27d6424a1faff3260d492b868a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11837/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat a large skillet over medium-high heat. Cook and stir beef, onion, bell pepper, and garlic in the hot skillet until beef is crumbly and browned, 5 to 7 minutes. Drain off fat and stir in undrained tomatoes, tomato paste, sugar, and oregano. Cook, stirring occasionally, until heated through.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/TCalVtgCgy8JbU1U9Aa9SpcsMgw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/11837-spaghetti-pie-ii-VAT-step-04-e9700f03564943c7ad701c7b9e62a41f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11837/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread cottage cheese over spaghetti crust, then pour in beef-tomato mixture.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/DXT0V0us-SQa0iDrgUPdJiOaTG4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/11837-spaghetti-pie-ii-VAT-step-05-5951c98266ae43c583c47dcf43dffa10.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11837/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven for 20 minutes. Sprinkle mozzarella cheese over the top of pie and continue baking until cheese is melted, about 5 minutes more. Let pie stand briefly before slicing to allow layers to set.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ltxadNmr1fj0bTrEFh4yJ8QKXn4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/11837-spaghetti-pie-ii-VAT-step-06-5ad7208704e247ca86cf1ba8b7d42525.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11837/step_06.webp"
    }
  ],
